Title: The Transfer Student

INT. CLASSROOM - AFTERNOON

[[scene: arrival]]

The door slides open. Aiko steps in, satchel clutched to her chest, as thirty pairs of eyes turn toward her.

AIKO
Um... hello. I'm Aiko. I just transferred in.

She bows, a little too deeply.

[[choice: Introduce yourself to the class -> greet]]
[[choice: Hurry to an empty seat -> observe]]

INT. CLASSROOM - AFTERNOON

[[scene: greet]]

Aiko straightens, takes a breath, and meets the room with a small, certain smile.

AIKO
I hope we can all get along this year.

[[next: rooftop]]

INT. CLASSROOM - EVENING

[[scene: observe]]

Aiko slips into the seat by the window and watches the courtyard until the room empties.

[[next: rooftop]]

EXT. ROOFTOP - EVENING

[[scene: rooftop]]

Aiko pushes through the heavy door to find the rooftop already occupied. Haruki leans against the fence, hands in his pockets, watching the courtyard lights flicker on.

AIKO
Oh — sorry. I didn't think anyone came up here.

HARUKI
Most people don't. That's the appeal.

He glances at her, then back to the view. Aiko hesitates, then steps up beside him.

AIKO
The new girl gets the quiet places, I guess.

HARUKI
Stick around. They stop being quiet.

A faint, dry smile. Aiko finds herself smiling too.

[[next: ending]]

INT. CLASSROOM - EVENING

[[scene: ending]]

The last of the light fades from the windows. A new chapter begins.
